1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,230
Can a cleansing oil work for acne-prone skin?

2
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:05,470
This is the Dermalogica PreCleanse.

3
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:10,462
In this review, we cover what it is, who it is for, and exactly how to use it.

4
00:00:11,162 --> 00:00:16,047
PreCleanse is a deep-cleansing oil that melts impurities and makeup from the skin.

5
00:00:16,747 --> 00:00:19,144
It is the first step of the Double Cleanse.

6
00:00:19,144 --> 00:00:23,659
You use it before your regular cleanser, so that cleanser can work on clean skin.

7
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:28,370
It melts away excess oil, sunscreen and even waterproof makeup.

8
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:32,761
It also lifts away pollutants and leftover products from your day.

9
00:00:33,461 --> 00:00:35,786
And it removes oils without clogging pores.

10
00:00:36,486 --> 00:00:42,400
The formula is a blend of borage seed, kukui, apricot, rice bran and vitamin E oils,

11
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,160
which condition the skin.

12
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:49,876
It is recommended for all skin types, including acne-prone skin and skin with

13
00:00:49,876 --> 00:00:50,775
visible pores.

14
00:00:51,539 --> 00:00:53,395
Yes, that includes oily skin.

15
00:00:53,395 --> 00:00:57,171
Oil helps dissolve oil, so excess sebum comes away with it.

16
00:00:57,871 --> 00:00:59,291
Here is how to use it.

17
00:00:59,291 --> 00:01:02,778
Pump it into dry hands and massage it over a dry face.

18
00:01:03,478 --> 00:01:07,510
Spend extra time on areas of congestion, like the nose and chin.

19
00:01:08,210 --> 00:01:10,564
Then wet your hands and keep massaging.

20
00:01:10,564 --> 00:01:13,159
The oil turns into a light, milky emulsion.

21
00:01:13,859 --> 00:01:18,491
Rinse with lukewarm water, then follow with your Dermalogica cleanser to finish the

22
00:01:18,491 --> 00:01:19,328
Double Cleanse.

23
00:01:20,084 --> 00:01:25,081
That is the Dermalogica PreCleanse: a deep-cleansing oil for all skin types,

24
00:01:25,081 --> 00:01:26,791
including acne-prone skin.

25
00:01:26,791 --> 00:01:28,829
The link is in the description.
